<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="6b4be1db">&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        &lt;div style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;
            In certain cases, assessment of test metrics and other information may warrant a stakeholder recommendation for
            a conditional sign-off. This occurs when certain known issues or defects have not been resolved within a given
            time frame but stakeholders agree to continue with next steps in the test effort. Stakeholders agree to move
            forward with the test effort knowing that outstanding issues or defects remain and may be resolved at a later
            time.&lt;br /&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="b520ef7b"></attribute>
<attribute name="usageGuidance" nodeId="6ab1d4cf"></attribute>
<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="301558f7">&lt;p&gt;
    When performing this task, assess what test metrics and information is useful for stakeholders to evaluate solution
    quality. This information helps stakeholders address the following questions:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Is the solution production ready?
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Is the test effort complete and have the exit acceptance criteria been achieved for all tests?
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Has the test effort achieved risk mitigation and have other new risks been identified?
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    A recommendation for production deployment is provided for stakeholder review and assessment. This recommendation is
    supported by summarization of test activities and key measures used to assess production readiness.&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
</Element>
